WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Check the displayed return window
The demo displays a 14-day request window. Use the configured window
shown in your store; do not assume every store uses the same duration.

2
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Read the request status
Pending means a decision is still needed; Refunded is a different stage.
Open the return number to inspect it. The linked order is the
fulfillment record, not a second return.

3
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Match the request to its order
Overview identifies the order, customer and requested refund method.
Review Items for quantities before deciding. A chosen refund method does
not mean a refund has happened.

4
00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:40.000
Review the next permitted action
Handling shows Approve or Reject for this pending request; rejection
asks for a reason. Review the history. Approval is a return decision,
not confirmation of receipt, inspection or refund.

